## Audio, Score & Sound Effects
- Original musical score (`mix.py`, 120 BPM in D Dorian → D Add9): composed procedurally in code for Pottsfield Studio.
- Physical string waveguide & modal music-box synthesis (`core/audio/pluck.py`) and procedural foley primitives (`core/audio/sfx.py`): from the Lemo-Opuscar toolkit, MIT Licence.
- Additional bowed cello/contrabass synthesis, stereo impulse response reverb, woodcut gouge foley, flint spark, and hearth ignition synthesis (`mix.py`): original procedural synthesis in Python (`numpy` / `scipy`), no external audio samples used.

